<p><em>Whether you are camping or at home, make something special like this <strong>Dutch oven chili</strong> with cornbread where you bake the cornbread in the same pot as your chili! Also known as cowboy chili, you are sure to be a hit at the campground. </em></p>



<p><em>Find more of my cast iron <a href="https://familyspice.com/how-to-cook-in-a-dutch-oven/">campfire Dutch oven recipes</a>.</em></p>



