ding="async" width="683" height="1024" data-attachment-id="25831" data-permalink="https://familyspice.com/campfire-carne-asada-fries/coals_flame-1200/" data-orig-file="https://familyspice.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/coals_flame-1200.jpg" data-orig-size="1200,1800" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="coals_flame-1200" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://familyspice.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/coals_flame-1200-683x1024.jpg" src="https://familyspice.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/coals_flame-1200-683x1024.jpg" alt="Overhead view of coals on fire in a coal chimney" class="wp-image-25831" srcset="https://familyspice.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/coals_flame-1200-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://familyspice.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/coals_flame-1200-360x540.jpg 360w, https://familyspice.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/coals_flame-1200-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://familyspice.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/coals_flame-1200-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://familyspice.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/coals_flame-1200-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://familyspice.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/coals_flame-1200-180x270.jpg 180w, https://familyspice.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/coals_flame-1200-300x450.jpg 300w, https://familyspice.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/coals_flame-1200.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px" /></noscript></figure>



<p>You will also need the ingredients and equipment to prepare the chili with cornbread. If you do your prep work at home, for example chop all the vegetables and place them in resealable bags, then you don&#8217;t need to bother bringing a cutting board or knife. Here is the full list of what you will most likely need:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><a data-lasso-id="436" data-lasso-name="Stainless Steel Mixing Bowls (Set of 5) , Non Slip Colorful Silicone Bottom Nesting Storage Bowls, Polished Mirror Finish For Healthy Meal Mixing and Prepping 1.5 - 2 - 2.5 - 3.5 - 7QT (Colorful)" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D3NRLML/?tag=familyspice07-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">mixing bowl</a></li>



<li><a data-lasso-id="437" data-lasso-name="OXO Good Grips 16-Inch Locking Tongs" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004OCM3/?tag=familyspice07-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">long metal tongs</a> or <a data-lasso-id="438" data-lasso-name="Long Wooden Spoons - Wooden Utensils - 15.7 Inch for Mixing Baking Serving Cooking Utensils Wood Spoon Large Handle for Baking or Party Craft 3 Piece" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BDPCC4D/?tag=familyspice07-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">wooden spoon</a></li>



<li><a data-lasso-id="439" data-lasso-name="EDELIN Measuring Cups and Magnetic Measuring Spoons Set, Stainless Steel 5 Cups and 7 Spoons and 1 Levele (13set)" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M6Q5MGF/?tag=familyspice07-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">measuring spoons and cups</a></li>



<li><a data-lasso-id="440" data-lasso-name="imarku Japanese Chef Knife - Pro Kitchen Knife 8 Inch Chef's Knives High Carbon Stainless Steel Sharp Paring Knife with Ergonomic Handle, Useful Kitchen Gadgets 2023" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DDBJF12/?tag=familyspice07-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">chef knife</a></li>



<li><a data-lasso-id="441" data-lasso-name="Gorilla Grip Durable Kitchen Cutting Board Set of 3, BPA Free, Reversible Use, Easy Grip Rubber Handles, Deep Juice Grooves, Large Food Chopping Boards, Dishwasher Safe, Chop Meat, Veggies, Black" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GP2MTXW/?tag=familyspice07-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">cutting board</a></li>



