<h2 id="dutch-oven-cornbread-chili"   class="wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold">Dutch Oven Cornbread Chili</h2>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
<span class="wprm-recipe-details wprm-recipe-author wprm-block-text-light">Laura Bashar | Family Spice</span>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
<div class="wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal"><span style="display: block;">Whether you are camping or at home, make something special like this Dutch oven chili with cornbread where you bake the cornbread in the same pot as your chili! Also known as cowboy chili, you are sure to be a hit at the campground. </span></div>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
