    <div class="wpd-comment-text">
    <p>If you are cooking this at home in the oven, yes, you can use a cast iron skillet. But it needs to be deep enough to allow room for the cornbread to bake and rise. If it is not deep enough, the cornbread will bake and spill over and make a mess.</p>

</div>
